---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | wagecheck"
  description="How wagecheck handles your data. We don't collect personal information — all calculations happen in your browser."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-white to-lime-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-emerald-700">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
          Privacy <span class="font-display italic text-emerald-600">Policy</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 sm:text-xl">
          How we handle your data
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">No Personal Data Collection</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">wagecheck does not collect, store or transmit any personal data. All salary calculations, stamp duty estimates and tax computations happen entirely within your browser using client-side JavaScript. Your salary figures, pension contributions, student loan plans and other inputs never leave your device.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">We do not use cookies to track you personally. The only cookies on this site are set by Google Analytics (see below) and can be managed through our cookie consent banner.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 3 19.875v-6.75ZM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V8.625ZM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V4.125Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Google Analytics</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how visitors use our site — for example, which calculators are most popular and how many people visit each page. GA4 anonymises your IP address and does not store personally identifying information.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Google Analytics uses cookies to distinguish unique users, aggregate usage data, and improve site performance. You can opt out of GA4 tracking entirely by declining analytics cookies in our consent banner, or by using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="font-semibold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818.879.659 1.236-2.02c.622-.462 1.29-.76 2.005-.967A6 6 0 1 1 12 6Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Google AdSense</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">wagecheck displays advertisements through Google AdSense. AdSense uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website or other websites on the internet. This allows Google and its partners to serve advertisements based on your interests.</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">You can manage your advertising preferences through our cookie consent banner, or visit <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" class="font-semibold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ad Settings</a> to opt out of personalised advertising.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 0 0 2.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 0 0 4.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 0 0-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 0 1 8.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0 1 11.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 1 1-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 0 1 6.75 0Zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 1 1-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 0 1 5.25 0Z" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Under the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR), you have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              <li><strong>Right of access</strong> — request a copy of any data we hold about you</li>
              <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> — request correction of inaccurate data</li>
              <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> — request deletion of your data</li>
              <li><strong>Right to restrict processing</strong> — request limitation of how your data is used</li>
              <li><strong>Right to object</strong> — object to processing of your data for specific purposes</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Since we do not collect personal data directly, most of these rights relate to data processed by third-party services such as Google Analytics. You can exercise your rights by contacting us or by managing your preferences directly with Google.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 px-8 py-6">
          <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07-1.916V6.75" /></svg>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@wagecheck.co.uk" class="font-semibold text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700">hello@wagecheck.co.uk</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: August 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
